'''Jooro Jarrot''', also known as "'''Speeds'''," was a [[Quarren]] member of a biker gang called the [[Ganguls]].<ref name="The Ganguls" /> When the biker gang expanded into a [[pirate]] gang, Jarrot remained as the Ganguls' second-in-command behind their leader [[Sellaccc Orryak]]. Jarrot used a [[net caster]] in combat.<ref name="The Jedi Rescue">{{YJA|The Jedi Rescue}}</ref>

